# Text files are stored and checked out with LF, whatever the platform, so a diff shows only real
# changes (a CRLF checkout on Windows makes whole files look rewritten, and a CRLF script or unit
# breaks inside the image).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Bytes that must never be converted: images, disk and package images, keys (their fingerprints
# and signatures cover the exact bytes), and patches applied to other trees.
*.png binary
*.iso binary
*.img binary
*.zst binary
*.asc -text
*.gpg -text
*.sig -text
*.patch -text
